# Changelog
## [1.0.14] - terminal window fix for windowss
** Setup script 1.0.4 -
* Fix for windows so if you start the app with the terminal window hidden when it launches the setup python script when that then starts the main app python script the window remains hidden. It can still be closed from either the taskbar icon or from within the dashboard interface on a web browser.

## [1.0.13] - network scanning fix
** Main App Script 1.0.10 -
* Fixed a bug with the network scan on windows after it getting broken again fixing a couple of other bits.

## [1.0.12] - Mac OS adapter type fix
** Main App Script 1.0.9 -
* Speed test network type auto updates with connection type. This can be changed manually but on mac os this was not being detected correctly.

## [1.0.11] - Network scan fixes, UI fixes
** Dashboard HTML 1.0.7 -
* Speed test name was being updated when an isolated scan was being done. This is now fixed.

## [1.0.10] - Network scan fixes, UI fixes
** Dashboard HTML 1.0.6 -
* Behaviour of loading page updated to remember where you were if you refresh the page but start from the interfaces page on start up.
* Updated formating of changelog

## [1.0.9] - Network scan fixes, UI fixes
** Main App Script 1.0.8 -
* Network scan fixes.
* 
** Dashboard HTML 1.0.5 -
* Isolated scan button was missing after a scan completed. This has now been fixed.
* Updated formating of changelog

